d style=\"padding: 10px; color: #555;\">{{ $json.bookingDate }}</td></tr></table><div style=\"margin-top: 24px; background-color: #fff8e1; border-left: 4px solid #f9a825; padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: 4px;\"><p style=\"margin: 0; color: #555; font-size: 14px;\">Please arrive 10 minutes early with a valid ID and any relevant medical records or prescriptions.</p></div><div style=\"margin-top: 16px; background-color: #e8f5e9; border-left: 4px solid #2e7d32; padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: 4px;\"><p style=\"margin: 0; color: #555; font-size: 14px;\">Medication reminder: Please continue taking your medications as prescribed and bring a list of all current medications to your appointment.</p></div><p style=\"margin-top: 24px; color: #555;\">If you need to reschedule or cancel, please contact us at least 24 hours in advance.</p><p style=\"color: #333; font-weight: bold;\">We look forward to seeing you!</p><p style=\"color: #333; font-weight: bold;\">The Clinic Team</p></div><div style=\"background-color: #f5f5f5; padding: 12px 24px; text-align: center;\"><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 12px; color: #999;\">This is an automated weekly reminder from our AI Clinic Assistant</p></div></div>",
